Looking at this problem, I need to find all nonzero integers $a$ and all pairs $(f,g)$ satisfying $f(x+g(y))=g(x)+f(y)+ay$ for all $x,y\in\mathbb{Q}$.

**Answer Leak Check:** The problem text contains no leaked solutions. Proceeding.

